{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Hey John! Haven't talked in a few days, wanted to let you know I joined a travel club! Always been interested in different cultures and countries and I'm excited to check it out. Can't wait to meet new people and learn about what makes them unique!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-43/session_21-554692c633dcda8d9395fed4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:45:02.523259+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "554692c633dcda8d9395fed4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "554692c633dcda8d9395fed4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Tim! That's cool! I love learning about different cultures. It's really cool to meet people with different backgrounds. My teammates come from all over."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-43/session_21-a584f6383b453b2d7ed18834", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:45:02.545430+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a584f6383b453b2d7ed18834", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a584f6383b453b2d7ed18834", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Wow! How long have you been playing professionally?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-43/session_21-b57c6e09f34ad4b3de62198d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:45:02.560681+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b57c6e09f34ad4b3de62198d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b57c6e09f34ad4b3de62198d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I've been playing professionally for just under a year now. It's been a wild ride."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-43/session_21-49ff294d9c5df06c845ddcb1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:45:02.574638+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "49ff294d9c5df06c845ddcb1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "49ff294d9c5df06c845ddcb1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Wow,! Being a pro basketball player must be quite a journey. Is it living up to your expectations?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-43/session_21-c2491ed3c740226be413664e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:45:02.588464+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c2491ed3c740226be413664e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c2491ed3c740226be413664e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, it's been great! Challenges, growth, all that jazz\u2014it's been amazing."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-43/session_21-2ac34c21d8da53f35807b6bf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:45:02.604879+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2ac34c21d8da53f35807b6bf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2ac34c21d8da53f35807b6bf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Cool! Glad to hear that this journey has been rewarding for you. Could you tell me more about your growth?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-43/session_21-7d676cc22fa5dc15f752d54f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:45:02.621770+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7d676cc22fa5dc15f752d54f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7d676cc22fa5dc15f752d54f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yup, on the court, I'm getting better at my overall game. Money-wise, I've gotten some cool endorsement deals. Plus, I'm learning how to market myself and boost my brand. It's been really rewarding to see all these areas progress. What about you? Anything new happening?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-43/session_21-c332d2d0e25c05c6327d0bf8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:45:02.641068+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c332d2d0e25c05c6327d0bf8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c332d2d0e25c05c6327d0bf8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Joined a travel club and, like I said, working on studies. Also picked up new skills. Recently started learning an instrument. Challenging but fun, always admired musicians. Finally giving it a go."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-43/session_21-234fdedfdc0042be04afff80", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:45:02.662333+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "234fdedfdc0042be04afff80", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "234fdedfdc0042be04afff80", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Learning an instrument is really cool. What instrument are you playing? What genres of music do you want to learn?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-43/session_21-631dda179a765b02586f3bc3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:45:02.679451+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "631dda179a765b02586f3bc3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "631dda179a765b02586f3bc3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: I'm learning how to play the violin now. I'm mostly into classical music but I'm keen to try out jazz and film scores too. It's a great way to chill and get creative."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-43/session_21-3cfcc31bb3d8b384059b4227", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:45:02.692422+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3cfcc31bb3d8b384059b4227", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3cfcc31bb3d8b384059b4227", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow! I hope I can hear you play the violin some day. How long have you been playing the piano again?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-43/session_21-9d022f1707d1b46084da3de5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:45:02.708647+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9d022f1707d1b46084da3de5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9d022f1707d1b46084da3de5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: I've been playing for about four months now and it's been an amazing adventure. I'm really enjoying the progress I've been making."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-43/session_21-3385dc57cc1d0576a2c3c893", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:45:02.723668+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3385dc57cc1d0576a2c3c893", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3385dc57cc1d0576a2c3c893", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Nice one! Learning something new is always a great adventure. Keep up the hard work and let's see where you end up. It's all about dedication and effort. It feels great to finally achieve something after putting in so much time and energy."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-43/session_21-43ac232aabfcee67433039e3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:45:02.737763+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "43ac232aabfcee67433039e3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "43ac232aabfcee67433039e3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Congrats on the trophy! It must have felt great to finally get something after putting in so much effort. Do you have any tips on motivating others on your team?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-43/session_21-96d177aaf5b8513fe3db4f10", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:45:02.754462+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "96d177aaf5b8513fe3db4f10", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "96d177aaf5b8513fe3db4f10", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! Winning was awesome. When motivating others, it's important to show care for teammates, celebrate their achievements, provide constructive feedback, and remind them of the bigger goal. Creating a positive environment and giving a pep talk before a game can also be helpful. It's all about supporting and uplifting each other. Do you have any specific strategies in mind?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-43/session_21-db85b9be7d37a02dbef40226", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:45:02.769587+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "db85b9be7d37a02dbef40226", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "db85b9be7d37a02dbef40226", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Thanks for the helpful advice. Creating a constructive atmosphere and setting an example by working hard can really inspire people. It\u2019s also inspiring to use our own stories to encourage others. Much appreciated!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-43/session_21-ded6cc38951dc19bc2b40f1a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:45:02.789160+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ded6cc38951dc19bc2b40f1a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ded6cc38951dc19bc2b40f1a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: No problem! It's great to use our own experiences to inspire others. Hard work can lead to success. Keep it up! Let me know if you need any assistance."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-43/session_21-10efd579c0ac88e857531b69", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:45:02.805127+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "10efd579c0ac88e857531b69", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "10efd579c0ac88e857531b69", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Thanks! Appreciate the offer. Let me know if you can lend a hand. Bye!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-43/session_21-e25224624c30e47905c91e2d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:45:02.820021+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e25224624c30e47905c91e2d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e25224624c30e47905c91e2d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
